Package: totaljs-vscode-source
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates, debconf | debconf-2.0
Homepage: https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/setup/linux
Description: The repository of Microsoft for Visual Studio Code, for the Total.js Developer Distros
 The signing key and the source of apt of the repository of Visual Studio Code (packages.microsoft.com),
 where the package code comes from. Visual Studio Code is not in Ubuntu and is not copied into the
 repository of Total.js: it is downloaded from Microsoft, and updated by apt. The key is the official one
 of Microsoft (fingerprint BC52 8686 B50D 79E3 39D3 721C EB3E 94AD BE12 29CF).
